><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/the-beat-of-rain-upon-the-land-broken-teardrop-in-my-hand">The beat of rain upon the land</a></li> </ul> </li> </ul> <p style="text-align: center;"><strong><em>Please add any characters, GoIs, or SCPs you use in your Aces and Eights tales to this list with their appropriate crosslinks.</em></strong></p> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /></p> </div> <br /></div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1414765&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609834931" alt="Doctor Cimmerian" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1414765)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" >Doctor Cimmerian</a></span></p> 
